# {{.Module}}

A Hyrule Platform project, scaffolded by `hyrule new`.

## Add Hyrule as a dependency

	go get github.com/Gui-Rondon/hyrule@main   # or a tagged version, once released

## Add a service

	hyrule service create <name>

This writes `services/<name>/`: a small `app.Main` binary with one
resource, a schema to extend, and a test using `testkit`.

## Local development

	make env-up              # Mongo, replica set, on :27017
	make build SERVICE=<name>
	make run SERVICE=<name>  # :8080, auth disabled

## Tests

	make test
